{"route":{"id":"17460","name":"Itinerari al pantà de Cal Gat","intro":"Itinerari fàcil però un pèl llarg, per la vora del Ter fins al pantà de Cal Gat i tornar. Primer per corriols obacs i després tornant seguint la <strong>Via Verda de la Ruta del Ferro i el Carbó.</strong> Gaudirem del paisatge de la vall i serres properes fins al cim del Taga; de masos i conreus a les <strong>planes al·luvials; rescloses i canals; de boscos de ribera i entorns humits amb elevat valor natural.</strong>","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Fàcil","durada":"3 hores","desnivell":"132.00 meters","distancia":"11.30 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Medi, Paisatgístic","imgs":["n17460_1.jpg","n17460_2.jpg","n17460_3.jpg","n17460_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-sant-joan-de-les-abadesses/itinerari-al-panta-de-cal-gat","track":[[42.233,2.28753],[42.23297,2.28746],[42.23294,2.28735],[42.23288,2.28723],[42.23284,2.28711],[42.23278,2.28696],[42.23273,2.28686],[42.23269,2.28681],[42.23259,2.28674],[42.23252,2.28663],[42.23246,2.28645],[42.23237,2.2863],[42.23234,2.28617],[42.23226,2.28602],[42.23221,2.28592],[42.23216,2.28578],[42.23216,2.28566],[42.23213,2.28552],[42.23209,2.2854],[42.23204,2.28529],[42.23196,2.28514],[42.23192,2.28504],[42.23187,2.28494],[42.23185,2.28482],[42.23179,2.28471],[42.23174,2.28457],[42.23169,2.28444],[42.23165,2.2843],[42.23161,2.28417],[42.23156,2.28405],[42.23152,2.28392],[42.23148,2.28379],[42.23142,2.28365],[42.23137,2.28352],[42.23131,2.28337],[42.23125,2.28323],[42.23119,2.2831],[42.23115,2.28297],[42.23109,2.28283],[42.23104,2.28267],[42.23098,2.28253],[42.23092,2.28237],[42.23086,2.28222],[42.23081,2.28207],[42.23076,2.28192],[42.23071,2.28178],[42.23067,2.28163],[42.23058,2.28151],[42.23047,2.28144],[42.23037,2.28138],[42.23026,2.28132],[42.23016,2.28126],[42.23005,2.28121],[42.22994,2.28117],[42.22983,2.28117],[42.22973,2.28121],[42.22962,2.28124],[42.22956,2.28119],[42.22951,2.